Decko itself: the GNU General Public License, version 3 or (at your option)
any later version. The full license text is in the LICENSE file.


Upstream project
----------------

    Decko
    https://github.com/decko-commons/decko
    https://decko.org

    Authors (as listed in the upstream gemspecs): Ethan McCutchen,
    Philipp Kühl, Gerry Gleason, and the Decko contributors.
    License: GPL-3.0-or-later (declared in the upstream gemspecs; the
    upstream LICENSE file carries the GNU GPL version 3 text).

Decko is a structured wiki web platform built on the "card" concept: a
database-backed tree of typed, nestable cards extended by mods. Its core
gems are:

    decko     the platform gem
    card      the card engine
    cardname  card names without all the cards

This project was written against a running Ruby Decko instance used as a
rendering oracle. The upstream versions targeted are:

    card     1.110.0
    decko    0.20.0

Parts of this project are direct ports of the corresponding Ruby source.
Those ports carry the upstream copyright and remain under the upstream
license. Ported files and areas are documented in ARCHITECTURE.md and in the
`docs/*-port-notes.md` series, which record the upstream file each area was
ported from.


